msgid "ViewPro Gimbals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:12
#: 6d2c6993d38545e18576ccf2f7cf04e6
msgid "ArduPilot 4.5 (and higher) support the `ViewPro <http://www.viewprotech.com/index.php?ac=article&at=list&tid=127>`__ gimbals using ViewPro's custom serial protocol."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:15
#: b34851ae44564eafaf467bc5827ec6e5
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:17
#: e79cb1ef80cd4ac0bfd2028af6a16b57
msgid "Connect one of the autopilot's serial ports to the gimbal as shown below.  The first image if for users with a \"viewport\" connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:28
#: ce194a5b22ef4bd8b75e7c017b39b059
msgid "Using 4.5.x (or higher):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:30
#: f950b4c8d56c43e78b8cf0fcd00dec43
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 8 (Gimbal).  This assumes the gimbal is attached to the autopilot's Serial2 port but any serial port can be used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:31
#: dcc34474d1434018a7c99b4c34a08fc1
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:32
#: 5e7aac881d8e4a53820c14d42b7f1f3d
msgid "Set :ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 11 (Viewpro)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:33
#: 7303e70f1a144eb5a84e60bfab59cc29
msgid "Set :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 4 (Mount) to enable the camera control using the mount driver"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:34
#: acfe633fd5ce4a63935093d22715cc0f
msgid ":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount Pitch\") to control the gimbal's pitch angle with RC channel 6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:35
#: 5a69dc0fb6db4ea2a057dbc73067a0e2
msgid ":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount Yaw\") to control the gimbal's yaw angle with RC channel 7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:37
#: e55e8b945606428682de0becb4eb1bf1
msgid "Optionally these auxiliary functions are also available"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:39
#: 6f62f5bcf08148528139c0f6c7e1c916
msgid ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 166 (\"Camera Record Video\") to start/stop recording of video"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:40
#: 9c49fc5445144bd4ae48e5766d331254
msgid ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 168 (\"Camera Manual Focus\") to adjust focus in and out"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:41
#: 8afd5903b5eb4bbcbbeafea4ee33d45c
msgid ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 169 (\"Camera Auto Focus\") to trigger auto focus"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:42
#: cd977770bb914e378d15278c5485556b
msgid ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 174 (\"Camera Image Tracking\") to track what is in the center of the image"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:43
#: 0044ca9b362f49a5ba9fae1e7c3433a1
msgid ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 175 (\"Camera Lens\") to select which video stream is sent to the GCS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:46
#: 606687dedc2543f4a2fd473e78f8399e
msgid "Control and Testing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:48
#: 6ae6f0cdffa6451ab32165ce30e6dd47
msgid "See :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>` and :ref:`Camera Controls <common-camera-controls>` for details on how to control the gimbal using RC, GCS or Auto mode mission commands"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:51
#: c64b672bb5c144ba94eb4d3a704274c5
msgid "Rangerfinder Control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:53
#: 63e8436316834255985e4eef38ee5d71
msgid "Some versions of the ViewPro Gimbals have a rangefinder that displays range in the OSD. This continuous ranging updating can be disabled using an RC switch whose ``RCx_OPTIONS`` is set to \"177\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:56
#: a75030d1f9e746f6a01a5d08de4da0e7
msgid "Testing Video Streaming"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:58
#: c717695d826f4bc888b0336f9efd7fdf
msgid "To test video streaming works using a Windows PC, connect the camera's ethernet cable to your local router."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:60
#: 94252dacb0e54c9ab431e52c8c0ffafc
msgid "Download and install `VLC media player <https://www.videolan.org/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:61
#: 14b23bc87bf84340bc844b9bd613b12a
msgid "On the PC, open Settings, Network & Internet, Ethernet"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:62
#: fc7835222041410c974c7b7a4786b128
msgid "Find the \"IP assignment\" section, click the \"Edit\" button and select \"Manual\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:64
#: a088c27f0bbb4f42814dba5fc7642995
msgid "Move the IPv4 slider to On"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:65
#: 82681895dae94b6db02b1ff1c28b239d
msgid "IP address: 192.168.2.118"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:66
#: fd826d80748e45a8990ce9b1378d5199
msgid "Subnet mask: 255.255.255.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:67
#: 16b312857b454096a7a29e9284f151aa
msgid "Gateway: 192.168.2.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:68
#: 11ae6d172faf4ea99d1342772254bfbe
msgid "Preferred DNS: 10.10.0.101"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:69
#: e6e8309cea9b489ebca4e3902d22c183
msgid "Press \"Save\" (note you will likely lose your internet connection)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:71
#: 461b2ae32c5049f696b4ef6db50df54a
msgid "Open VLC media player, Select Media, Open Network Stream, Network and enter \"rtsp://192.168.2.119:554\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:72
#: 5330a30311b24b02b15dadaffd5ee5ad
msgid "Once completed testing, restore your internet by reverting the PC's \"IP assignment\" to \"Automatic (DHCP)\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:74
#: 06391982fcd44953994fc5a5a16903c1
msgid "Video can also be streamed to QGroundControl"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:76
#: c58c499c315945a3833933ad33ced1c4
msgid "Open a web browser and enter the URL, \"http://192.168.2.119:8554/index.html\" to open the Viewpro System settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:77
#: 5e323f800b2e4eb3a0244c2341ae6c2c
msgid "Change the \"Stream Type\" to \"h.265\" as shown below"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:83
#: 0beb2113b2584e4c94fe0c1ff3accecd
msgid "Open QGC's Application Settings, General, and set Video Settings, Source to RTSP Video Stream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:84
#: 8c87b1e2b0d2441fbf8372a478f410b9
msgid "Set RTSP URL to \"rtsp://192.168.2.119:554\" as shown below"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:90
#: e94c269c13874a0fb563c818508c4cd2
msgid "If using Mission Planner, the live video can be displayed on the Data screen by following :ref:`these instructions <planner:live-video>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:93
#: 54e96b37bab84d68beab448b5ad72141
msgid "Downloading Images and Videos"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:95
#: ba5e2cd4036c47898c75e446b517a02c
msgid "If the gimbal is connected using Ethernet, images and videos stored on the SD card may be downloaded manually using the built-in webserver.  Using your favourite browser open http://192.168.2.119:8554/download (assuming the gimbal is using the default IP address)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:97
#: 911c8177e0fb4ed9a56a7c27e436f6aa
msgid "`wget <https://www.gnu.org/software/wget/>`__ can also be used to download all images and videos with a single command"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:99
#: e7d2b4c5d65b43b18d3f827231cd26dd
msgid "On Windows, ``wget.exe -r -l 10 --convert-links http://192.168.2.119:8554/download/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:100
#: bf63c26511d547a3acce28b420ec8c0f
msgid "On Linux/Ubuntu ``wget -r -l 10 --convert-links http://192.168.2.119:8554/download/``"
msgstr ""
